CueTake adds high-resolution tab capture, configurable pointer rendering,
per-frame camera composition, a scenario CLI, artifact management, and validation.
This project is independently maintained and is not an official Pagecast release.

Development agent skills in .agents/skills/ (linked from .claude/skills/) are
copied from Matt Pocock's skills: https://github.com/mattpocock/skills
They are used to develop CueTake, are not part of the CueTake runtime, and
remain under their MIT license, included in .agents/skills/LICENSE.
